# Instance configs used to hold machine-specific real host paths, so only the template was
# committed -- no longer true (2026-08-06): base_dir is now the container-internal /data/base
# path for every instance, and this file is bind-mounted straight into the container at
# runtime (see docker-compose.yml) instead of being COPY'd/duplicated at build time. Tracked
# in git now, not ignored.

